// From the law, Schedule 3 of the 2018 Act: blue, yellow and blue horizontal portions, the
// blue ones equal, with a large white 12-pointed star below the yellow on the hoist side.
// From elsewhere, on a hoist of 24: band 1/12 of the hoist, star center 1/4 of the fly from
// the hoist, and outer diameter 1/3 of the hoist are the 1968 specifications as FOTW quotes
// them. The inner diameter of 4 units and the upper point touching the band are the Album
// des Pavillons 2000's, as FOTW reports it. That puts the star's center at 13 + 4 = 17.
// The Act's own drawing agrees with these figures. Colors are the Album's, through FOTW.
vexyl 1
meta {
  name "Nauru"
  encoder "Naomi Persephone Amethyst"
  license "Apache-2.0"
  source "https://web.archive.org/web/20241210051242id_/http://ronlaw.gov.nr/nauru_lpms/files/acts/5e064e37e049dbe9392bb6474bad5e77.pdf"
  source "https://www.crwflags.com/fotw/flags/nr.html"
  note "The Act describes the flag in words and a drawing, with no numbers or proportion. The 1:2 and the measurements are from the Republic of Nauru Flag Specifications of 31 May 1968, whose text wasn't read and is known from FOTW, and from the Album des Pavillons 2000, also through FOTW."
  note "The Act gives no shades. Pantone 280 C and 123 C were given as official by Nauru's government to the Album's editor in 1997, by FOTW's account. The hex and CMYK are the Album des Pavillons 2023's for them, also through FOTW. White is plain white."
  note "FOTW reports that the country's international name became Naoero on 26 June 2026. The flag isn't reported to have changed."
  law "Naoero National Anthem Emblem and Flag Protection Act 2018, section 13 and Schedule 3" {
    source "https://web.archive.org/web/20241210051242id_/http://ronlaw.gov.nr/nauru_lpms/files/acts/5e064e37e049dbe9392bb6474bad5e77.pdf"
  }
}
palette {
  blue "#00267f" {
    pantone "280 C"
    cmyk 100 89 27 8
  }
  yellow "#ffc726" {
    pantone "123 C"
    cmyk 0 24 88 0
  }
  white "#ffffff"
}
proportion hoist=24 fly=48

bars blue yellow blue {
  ratio 11 2 11
}
charge star white {
  radius 4
  inner 2
  points 12
  at fly=12 hoist=17
}
